# The solved fold-up desk at a = 0.9489 rad, where the board passes closest
# to the lamp, in a tall window: the canvas and the Margins plot, Properties
# closed so that the plot takes the canvas's width; then the Constraints
# panel in a wider right column, where the formulas fit.
size 1600 1500
open docs/instances/guide-b-desk.json
solve
panel constraints
action view.panel.properties
wait 16
# The a slider, Ctrl-clicked to type its value; the pointer then leaves it,
# which would stay highlighted.
click L 400 1078 ctrl
wait 2
text "0.9489"
key Enter
move 1590 10
wait 16
shot desk.ppm
# The border between the left column and the right one, dragged left.
drag L 1023 400 700 400
move 1590 10
wait 16
shot constraints.ppm
